  "text": "Skip to content\nSoren Hale\n01\nWork\n02\nServices\n03\nAbout\n04\nLab\n05\nWriting\nOpen to work from November\nGet in touch\n\n// FAQ\n\nAsked before every project. \n\nEight short answers. If yours is not here, write to me and it will be by next month.\n\nAsk something else\n\nSomething else?\n\nReplies within one working day\n\nAsk by email\n01\nWhen are you available?\n\nI take on one main project at a time and usually book four to six weeks ahead. The status line at the top of the site is kept up to date.\n\n02\nDo you work alone or with a team?\n03\nHow do you price a project?\n04\nDo you only work in React?\n05\nCan you work without a finished design?\n06\nWill you work in our existing codebase?\n07\nWhat happens when the project ends?\n08\nWhich hours do you work?\n\n// Start a project\n\nTell me what you are building. \n\nThree quick picks so the first reply is useful. You finish the message on the contact page.\n\n01\nWhat do you need?\n\nFrontend build\nPerformance audit\nDesign system\nTeam embed\nSomething else\n\n02\nRough budget\n\nUnder €5k\n€5–10k\n€10–25k\n€25k+\nNot sure yet\n03\nYour name or company\nbrief.ts\ndraft, not sent\nexport const brief = {\nkind: null // not picked yet,\nbudget: null // not picked yet,\nname: null // not picked yet,\n}\n\nBrief so far: nothing picked yet\n\nContinue to contact\n\nor write to hello@sorenhale.dev\n\nNothing is sent from this page. Your picks are kept in this browser tab and wait for you on the contact form.\n\nFooter\n\nFrontend developer, Oslo\n\nWrite to me\nhello@sorenhale.dev\n\nOpen to work from November\n\n// Site\n\nWork\nServices\nProcess\nReviews\nContact\n\n// About\n\nAbout\nResume\nStack\nUses\nNow\n\n// More\n\nLab\nWriting\nFAQ\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCookies\n\n// Elsewhere\n\nGitHub\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nLinkedIn\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\nBluesky\n↗\n(opens in a new tab)\n\nLocal time, Oslo\n--:--\n\n© 2026 Soren Hale. Written by hand in Oslo.\n\nSorenHale\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.",
